<title>GERMANY: Brau und Brunnen shares suspended - bours.</title>
<headline>Brau und Brunnen shares suspended - bours.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Duesseldorf stock exchange said trade in brewing and drinks group Brau und Brunnen AG had been suspended. There was no immediate word on the reason for the suspension.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
